#: pyanaconda/errors.py:109
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following errors occurred with your partitioning:\n"
"\n"
"%(errortxt)s\n"
"\n"
"The installation will now terminate."
msgstr ""
"Nodalīšanā radās šīs kļūdas:\n"
"\n"
"%(errortxt)s\n"
"\n"
"Instalēšana tagad tiks pārtraukta."

# translation auto-copied from project Anaconda, version master, document
# anaconda
#: pyanaconda/errors.py:115
#, python-format
msgid "An error occurred while resizing the device %s."
msgstr "Mainot ierīces %s izmēru, radās kļūda."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:124
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There is a problem with your existing storage configuration: %(errortxt)s\n"
"\n"
"You must resolve this matter before the installation can proceed. There is a "
"shell available for use which you can access by pressing ctrl-alt-f1 and "
"then ctrl-b 2.\n"
"\n"
"Once you have resolved the issue you can retry the storage scan. If you do "
"not fix it you will have to exit the installer."
msgstr ""
"Radusies problēma ar esošo krātuves konfigurāciju: %(errortxt)s\n"
"\n"
"Tā jāatrisina, pirms instalēšana var turpināties. Ir pieejama čaula, kurai "
"var piekļūt, nospiežot ctrl-alt-f1 un tad ctrl-b 2.\n"
"\n"
"Kad problēma būs atrisināta, varat mēģināt krātuvi skenēt vēlreiz. Ja to "
"neatrisināsiet, būs jāiziet no instalētāja."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:133 pyanaconda/ui/gui/main.glade.h:1
msgid "_Exit Installer"
msgstr "_Iziet no instalētāja"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:133
msgid "_Retry"
msgstr "_Mēģināt vēlreiz"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:140
msgid ""
"An error has occurred - no valid devices were found on which to create new "
"file systems.  Please check your hardware for the cause of this problem."
msgstr ""
"Radās kļūda — nav atrasta neviena derīga ierīce, kurā izveidot jaunas datņu "
"sistēmas.  Lūdzu, pārbaudiet aparatūru, lai atrastu problēmas cēloni."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:147
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following file systems for your Linux system were not unmounted "
"cleanly.  Would you like to mount them anyway?\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Šīs Linux sistēmas datņu sistēmas netika korekti atmontētas.  Vai tomēr "
"vēlaties tās montēt?\n"
"%s"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:158
msgid ""
"There is an entry in your /etc/fstab file that contains an invalid or "
"incorrect file system type:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Failā /etc/fstab ir ieraksts ar nederīgu vai nepareizu datņu sistēmas tipu:\n"
"\n"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:164
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The ISO image %s has a size which is not a multiple of 2048 bytes.  This may "
"mean it was corrupted on transfer to this computer.\n"
"\n"
"It is recommended that you exit and abort your installation, but you can "
"choose to continue if you think this is in error. Would you like to continue "
"using this image?"
msgstr ""
"ISO tēla %s izmērs nav 2048 baitu daudzkārtnis.  Tas var nozīmēt, ka tas "
"tika bojāts, pārsūtot uz šo datoru.\n"
"\n"
"Ieteicams iziet un pārtraukt instalēšanu, bet varat izvēlēties turpināt, ja "
"domājat, ka tā ir kļūda. Vai vēlaties turpināt lietot šo tēlu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:178
msgid ""
"The installer has tried to mount the installation image, but cannot find it "
"on the hard drive.\n"
"\n"
"Should I try again to locate the image?"
msgstr ""
"Instalētājs mēģināja montēt instalēšanas tēlu, bet nevar to atrast cietajā "
"diskā.\n"
"\n"
"Vai mēģināt atrast tēlu vēlreiz?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:188
#, python-format
msgid "An error occurred mounting the source device %s. Retry?"
msgstr "Montējot avota ierīci %s, radās kļūda. Vai mēģināt vēlreiz?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:196
#, python-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred unmounting the disc.  Please make sure you're not "
"accessing %s from the shell on tty2 and then click OK to retry."
msgstr ""
"Atmontējot disku, radās kļūda.  Lūdzu, pārliecinieties, ka nepiekļūstat %s "
"no čaulas tty2, un tad noklikšķiniet „Labi”, lai mēģinātu vēlreiz."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:204
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The group '%s' is required for this installation. This group does not exist. "
"This is a fatal error and installation will be aborted."
msgstr ""
"Šai instalācijai nepieciešama grupa „%s”. Šī grupa neeksistē. Tā ir fatāla "
"kļūda, un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:210
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have specified that the group '%s' should be installed.  This group does "
"not exist.  Would you like to ignore this group and continue with "
"installation?"
msgstr ""
"Norādīts, ka jāinstalē grupa „%s”.  Šī grupa neeksistē.  Vai vēlaties "
"ignorēt šo grupu un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:215
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have specified that the group '%s' should be excluded from "
"installation.  This group does not exist.  Would you like to ignore this "
"group and continue with installation?"
msgstr ""
"Norādīts, ka grupa „%s” jāizslēdz no instalēšanas.  Šī grupa neeksistē.  Vai "
"vēlaties ignorēt šo grupu un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:227
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The package '%s' is required for this installation. This package does not "
"exist. This is a fatal error and installation will be aborted."
msgstr ""
"Šai instalācijai nepieciešama pakotne „%s”. Šī pakotne neeksistē. Tā ir "
"fatāla kļūda, un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:234
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You have specified that the package '%s' should be installed.  This package "
"does not exist.  Would you like to ignore this package and continue with "
"installation?"
msgstr ""
"Norādīts, ka jāinstalē pakotne „%s”.  Šī pakotne neeksistē.  Vai vēlaties "
"ignorēt šo pakotni un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:245
#, python-format
msgid ""
"There was an error running the kickstart script at line %(lineno)s.  This is "
"a fatal error and installation will be aborted.  The details of this error "
"are:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"
msgstr ""
"Izpildot kickstart skriptu %(lineno)s. rindā, radās kļūda.  Tā ir fatāla "
"kļūda, un instalēšana tiks pārtraukta.  Kļūdas informācija:\n"
"\n"
"%(details)s"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:253
msgid ""
"The following error occurred while installing.  This is a fatal error and "
"installation will be aborted."
msgstr ""
"Instalēšanas laikā radās šī kļūda.  Tā ir fatāla kļūda, un instalēšana tiks "
"pārtraukta."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:261
msgid ""
"The following software marked for installation has errors.  This is likely "
"caused by an error with\n"
"your installation source."
msgstr ""
"Instalēšanai atzīmētajā programmatūrā ir kļūdas.\n"
"Visticamāk, tās izraisa kļūda instalēšanas avotā."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:269
msgid ""
"The following error occurred while installing the boot loader. The system "
"will not be bootable. Would you like to ignore this and continue with "
"installation?"
msgstr ""
"Instalējot sāknētāju, radās šī kļūda. Sistēmu nevarēs sāknēt. Vai vēlaties "
"to ignorēt un turpināt instalēšanu?"

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:282
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Installation was stopped due to an error installing the boot loader. The "
"exact error message is:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"The installer will now terminate."
msgstr ""
"Instalēšana tika apturēta sāknētāja instalēšanas kļūdas dēļ. Precīzais "
"kļūdas ziņojums:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Instalētājs tagad beigs darbu."

#: pyanaconda/errors.py:290
#, python-format
msgid "Unable to encrypt password: unsupported algorithm %s"
msgstr "Neizdevās šifrēt paroli: neatbalstīts algoritms %s"

#: pyanaconda/exception.py:104
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The installation was stopped due to what seems to be a problem with your "
"hardware. The exact error message is:\n"
"\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
" The installer will now terminate."
msgstr ""
"Instalēšana tika apturēta, jo, šķiet, radusies problēma ar aparatūru. "
"Precīzais kļūdas ziņojums:\n"
"\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
" Instalētājs tagad beigs darbu."

#: pyanaconda/exception.py:108
msgid "Hardware error occurred"
msgstr "Radās aparatūras kļūda"

#: pyanaconda/exception.py:143
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"The installation was stopped due to an error which occurred while running in "
"non-interactive cmdline mode. Since there cannot be any questions in cmdline "
"mode, edit your kickstart file and retry installation. \n"
"The exact error message is: \n"
"\n"
"%s. \n"
"\n"
"The installer will now terminate."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Instalēšana tika apturēta kļūdas dēļ, kas radās, darbojoties neinteraktīvā "
"komandrindas režīmā. Tā kā komandrindas režīmā nevar uzdot jautājumus, "
"rediģējiet kickstart failu un mēģiniet instalēt vēlreiz. \n"
"Precīzais kļūdas ziņojums: \n"
"\n"
"%s. \n"
"\n"
"Instalētājs tagad beigs darbu."

#: pyanaconda/exception.py:151
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Running in cmdline mode, no interactive debugging allowed.\n"
"The exact error message is: \n"
"\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
"The installer will now terminate."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Darbojas komandrindas režīmā, interaktīva atkļūdošana nav atļauta.\n"
"Precīzais kļūdas ziņojums: \n"
"\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
"Instalētājs tagad beigs darbu."

